# Case 1 — CBC-MAC randomness expander: does the run take the packaged CE door?
#
# Ground truth (from the reference proof, now held out of the tree):
# the bound goes through the packaged seeded-condition-C endpoint, NOT the raw
# Theorem 4.17 and NOT the H-technique.

TARGET_SRC="RandomSystems/CBCMAC.lean"
