# The flagship claim of the skill: route to the packaged endpoint.
EXPECT_DEP="RandomSystems.CR18.maxAdvantage_filterQueries_seededConditionCGame_le"

# The wrong door. Taking the raw Theorem 4.17 means the run inherited Γᵇ and
